# Git

## Branches

One unit = one branch off `main`, named `unit/<X>-<slug>`. Never work on
`main` or `master`.

## Commits (proposed by you, executed by the human)

One concern per commit. Subject, one line:

```
[scope] action — reason
```

The em dash before `reason` is required.

| Pass | Fail |
|---|---|
| `[ingress] persist correlation id — retries must not double-dial` | `[ingress] persist correlation id` |

## Agent never

`commit`, `push`, `merge`, PR open, force-push, history rewrite, branch delete.

The human runs git mutations.
